{"reviewId": "319062742_7XVgLdOvX", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "环保主义、温室气体、绿色食品、低碳生活、太阳能风电、电动车，这一系列流行趋势的兴起都与国家的发展阶段和人的代际更迭密切相关。\n       50年代的人吃饱吃好最重要，70后的家庭主妇成为绿色食品的坚定支持者，90后成了电动车的主流消费者。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "abstract": "以我们对康波的理解，虽然康波一般在进入衰退之后才更容易引起人们对这一理论的重视，但事实上，人生就是一场康波。康波的形成是人的集体行为的结果，而这种集体行为取决于人的代际更迭。", "range": "899-986", "reviewId": "319062742_7XVgLdOvX", "userVid": 319062742, "topics": [], "createTime": 1739408970, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 6, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 319062742, "name": "不读小说", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/ugBoV3VerYOrPkH77IK7Qa0C0ic7iaaklddI4iakCYHZibLcByI5pbQ3d3FgZ4EiasbLl1oEsjDcXSlrgJDicYia5XZEg/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "不读小说", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M2-0-3000", "desc": "阅读时长", "title": "阅读时长", "levelIndex": 3000}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 28, "likes": [{"userVid": 407914983, "name": "云出", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/DYAIOgq83er0GQRBsIr0nvia5ib1uAYh9Infzh9GQKNVqeZN4ELoylUnymHVEY5jQvHO9FyFwicEZK5m09yuCz3Ug/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "爱好看书佛学和运动", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20241209-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}], "commentsCount": 2, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "比方19世纪中产观念的塑造，对之后的社会生活社会结构的形成有巨大的作用。",